### Preset ID

isaqb-architecture-governance

### Preset Name

iSAQB Architecture Governance

### Version

0.2.2

### Description

Adds iSAQB/CPSA-F and arc42 architecture governance, architecture views, quality scenarios, ADRs, risks, technical-debt evidence, and provider-neutral model routing.

### Author

Thorsten Hindermann

### Repository URL

https://github.com/hindermath/spec-kit-preset-isaqb-architecture-governance

### Download URL

https://github.com/hindermath/spec-kit-preset-isaqb-architecture-governance/archive/refs/tags/v0.2.2.zip

### Documentation URL

https://github.com/hindermath/spec-kit-preset-isaqb-architecture-governance/blob/v0.2.2/README.md
  * `quality-scenarios-template` — iSAQB quality-attribute scenarios
  * `architecture-decision-template` — Architecture Decision Record
  * `architecture-risks-template` — architecture risks and technical debt

### Commands Provided

  * `speckit.specify` — wraps Specify with iSAQB architecture-governance checks
  * `speckit.plan` — wraps Plan with iSAQB and arc42 architecture-governance checks
  * `speckit.tasks` — wraps Tasks with architecture work-product checks

### Number of Scripts (optional)

0

### Tags

architecture, governance, isaqb, arc42, model-routing

### Key Features

  * Updates the currently cataloged v0.2.1 entry to the exact v0.2.2 release.
  * Publishes a provider-neutral `model-routing.json` contract so Spec Kit commands declare workload roles while concrete model selections remain machine-local.
  * Preserves the existing iSAQB and arc42 behavior; the v0.2.2 functional addition is the composable model-routing contract.
  * Retains architecture goals, context, building-block, runtime and deployment views, quality scenarios for resumability and partial failure, ADRs, risks, and technical-debt evidence.
